<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Atlas Honda first half net up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Atlas Honda first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		  1,781 vs 1,492</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 105 vs    80</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit	 70 vs    53</p>
<p>    Interim div	    nil vs nil (per 10-rupee share)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Atlas Honda Ltd. It manufactures motorcycles at its plant in Karachi. The firm carried 70 million as unappropriated profit to the balance sheet. It has not announced any book closure.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
